DTSTAMP:20261111T134759Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
SUMMARY:Euclid: First big data release (DR1-Foundation)
DESCRIPTION:Maps the shapes and distances of more than a billion galaxies
  to trace dark matter and dark energy. The first big release opens about 
 1\,900 square degrees\, one seventh of the planned survey\; the complete 
 first release follows in mid-2027. https://techamatuer.github.io/Space-La
 b/
